{"id":"fdc5783bcc51ac51","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-cor-schreier.md","title":"Schreier's Theorem","display":"cor-schreier — Schreier's Theorem","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-schreier","aliases":["58-cor-schreier"],"display":"cor-schreier — Schreier's Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch10/58-thm-schreier.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-subgroup.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-schreier"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-schreier</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-schreier — Schreier's Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8349bf0f770c2db3\" href=\"?note=8349bf0f770c2db3\" title=\"../batch10/58-thm-schreier.md\">../batch10/58-thm-schreier.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"59685d062adf2748\" href=\"?note=59685d062adf2748\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-subgroup.md\">../batch02/58-df-subgroup.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,H,\\cdot,B,i\\in V\">\\(G,H,\\cdot,B,i\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cdot_H=\\cdot\\upharpoonright(H\\times H)\">\\(\\cdot_H=\\cdot\\upharpoonright(H\\times H)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreeBasis}_S(B;G,\\cdot,i)\">\\(\\mathrm{FreeBasis}_S(B;G,\\cdot,i)\\)</span> 为依赖文件中的四参数泛性质；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(H,G,\\cdot)\">\\(\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(H,G,\\cdot)\\)</span> 使用三参数接口。</li>\n<li>本文件定义二参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreeGroup}_S(G,\\cdot)\">\\(\\mathrm{FreeGroup}_S(G,\\cdot)\\)</span>、原有一参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreeGroup}_S(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{FreeGroup}_S(G)\\)</span> 及二参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreeBasis}_S(B,G)\">\\(\\mathrm{FreeBasis}_S(B,G)\\)</span> 的兼容投影。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreeGroup}_S(G,\\cdot)\\leftrightarrow\\exists B,i\\in V\\;\\mathrm{FreeBasis}_S(B;G,\\cdot,i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FreeGroup}_S(G,\\cdot)\\leftrightarrow\\exists B,i\\in V\\;\\mathrm{FreeBasis}_S(B;G,\\cdot,i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreeGroup}_S(G)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\cdot\\in V\\;\\mathrm{FreeGroup}_S(G,\\cdot).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FreeGroup}_S(G)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\cdot\\in V\\;\\mathrm{FreeGroup}_S(G,\\cdot).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreeBasis}_S(B,G)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\cdot,i\\in V\\;\\mathrm{FreeBasis}_S(B;G,\\cdot,i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FreeBasis}_S(B,G)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\cdot,i\\in V\\;\\mathrm{FreeBasis}_S(B;G,\\cdot,i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}schreier}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FreeGroup}_S(G,\\cdot)\\land\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(H,G,\\cdot)\n\\to\\bigl(\\mathrm{FreeGroup}_S(H,\\cdot\\upharpoonright(H\\times H))\\land\n\\exists B,i\\in V\\;\\mathrm{FreeBasis}_S(B;H,\\cdot\\upharpoonright(H\\times H),i)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}schreier}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FreeGroup}_S(G,\\cdot)\\land\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(H,G,\\cdot)\n\\to\\bigl(\\mathrm{FreeGroup}_S(H,\\cdot\\upharpoonright(H\\times H))\\land\n\\exists B,i\\in V\\;\\mathrm{FreeBasis}_S(B;H,\\cdot\\upharpoonright(H\\times H),i)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Nielsen–Schreier theorem: every subgroup of a free group is free.</li>\n<li>The former unrestricted cardinal-arithmetic equation is not a theorem of ZFC.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch10/58-thm-schreier.md","status":"resolved","id":"8349bf0f770c2db3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-thm-schreier.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-subgroup.md","status":"resolved","id":"59685d062adf2748","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-subgroup.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G,H,\\cdot,B,i\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\cdot_H=\\cdot\\upharpoonright(H\\times H)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FreeBasis}_S(B;G,\\cdot,i)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(H,G,\\cdot)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FreeGroup}_S(G,\\cdot)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FreeGroup}_S(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FreeBasis}_S(B,G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FreeGroup}_S(G,\\cdot)\\leftrightarrow\\exists B,i\\in V\\;\\mathrm{FreeBasis}_S(B;G,\\cdot,i).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FreeGroup}_S(G)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\cdot\\in V\\;\\mathrm{FreeGroup}_S(G,\\cdot).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FreeBasis}_S(B,G)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\cdot,i\\in V\\;\\mathrm{FreeBasis}_S(B;G,\\cdot,i).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}schreier}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FreeGroup}_S(G,\\cdot)\\land\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(H,G,\\cdot)\n\\to\\bigl(\\mathrm{FreeGroup}_S(H,\\cdot\\upharpoonright(H\\times H))\\land\n\\exists B,i\\in V\\;\\mathrm{FreeBasis}_S(B;H,\\cdot\\upharpoonright(H\\times H),i)\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1415,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-87","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-cor-schreier.md|58-cor-schreier]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["8349bf0f770c2db3","59685d062adf2748"]}